### Forgot Password
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/forgot-password
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "abdultalif5@gmail.com"
}


@token_reset = 650d7911-20b8-4cd4-9bcd-1e16ae255313

### Verification Token Reset Password
GET  http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/validate-forgot-token?token={{token_reset}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

### Reset Password
PATCH  http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/reset-password?token={{token_reset}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "password_new": "talif12345",
    "password_confirmation": "talif12345"

}

