### Create Role
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/role
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{
    "name": "Customer"
}

### Delete Role
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/role/5
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

### Get Role By ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/role/3
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

### Get All Role
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/role?search=
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

